# Machine Learning

## Project Description
This repository contains machine learning projects and examples implemented in Python.

## Features
- Data preprocessing
- Model training
- Model evaluation
- Prediction

## Technologies Used
- Python
- NumPy
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib

## Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/jyotadela/Machine-Learning.git
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run the project:

```bash
python main.py
```

